What this licence covers: the code (library/, except library/web/vendor/) and
the texts written for this project (this repository's README, docs/, the notes
and reports, and library/content/).

What it does not cover, because it is not ours to license:

- Material gathered from archives, libraries, museums, publishers and websites:
  scans, photographs, documents, PDFs, saved pages, catalogue records, tables,
  and the pictures made from them. Each stays under the rights its holder
  states; the manifest.md beside each file records them. Being in this
  repository grants no rights to any of it.
- library/web/vendor/: three.js, Copyright 2010-2026 Three.js Authors, under
  its own MIT licence.
- library/map-data/: built from OpenStreetMap (© OpenStreetMap contributors,
  Open Database License 1.0) and from the LiDAR survey of the Provincia
  autonoma di Bolzano – Alto Adige (CC0).
